			"content": "# Carousel 设计规范\n\n- `Carousel.Root` 渲染 `role=\"region\"`，必须用 `aria-label` 说明轮播的内容；每个 `Carousel.Item` 已标为一张幻灯片。\n- 用 `Carousel.Previous`、`Carousel.Next` 提供翻页按钮，它们的读屏文字默认是“上一张”“下一张”，其他语言用 `label` 改。\n- 行为用 `opts`（Embla 选项，如 `loop`、`align`）和 `plugins` 配置；需要读取当前页或跳转时用 `setApi` 拿到 API，不要自己监听滚动。\n- 自动播放会打断阅读：使用自动播放插件时必须提供暂停按钮，并在悬停和聚焦时暂停。\n- 重要内容不要只放在后面几张幻灯片里，用户很少翻到最后。\n",
			"type": "registry:file",
			"target": "carousel/RULES.md"
		},
		{
			"content": "<script lang=\"ts\">\n\timport { CarouselContent as SdkContent, CarouselViewport as SdkViewport } from \"@ui-sdk/svelte/carousel\";\n\timport { createAttachmentKey } from \"svelte/attachments\";\n\timport emblaCarouselSvelte from \"embla-carousel-svelte\";\n\timport { cn, type WithElementRef } from \"$UTILS$.js\";\n\timport { getEmblaContext } from \"./context.js\";\n\timport type { HTMLAttributes } from \"svelte/elements\";\n\n\tlet {\n\t\tref = $bindable(null),\n\t\tclass: className,\n\t\tchildren,\n\t\t...restProps\n\t}: WithElementRef<HTMLAttributes<HTMLDivElement>> = $props();\n\n\tconst emblaCtx = getEmblaContext(\"<Carousel.Content/>\");\n\tconst attachKey = createAttachmentKey();\n\tfunction attachRef(element: HTMLDivElement) {\n\t\tref = element;\n\t\treturn () => { if (ref === element) ref = null; };\n\t}\n\tconst classes = $derived(cn(\"flex\", emblaCtx.orientation === \"horizontal\"\n\t\t? \"-ms-4\"\n\t\t: \"-mt-4 flex-col\", className));\n</script>\n\n{#if emblaCtx.sdk}\n\t<SdkViewport data-slot=\"carousel-content\" tabindex={0} class=\"scrollbar-none focus-visible:-outline-offset-1 focus-visible:outline-ring data-[orientation=vertical]:h-full\">\n\t\t{#snippet render({ props: viewportProps })}\n\t\t\t<div {...viewportProps} data-slot=\"carousel-content\">\n\t\t\t\t<SdkContent class={cn(\"gap-4\", emblaCtx.orientation === \"vertical\" && \"h-full\", className)} {...restProps}>\n\t\t\t\t\t{#snippet render({ props })}\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div {...{ ...props, [attachKey]: attachRef }} data-slot=\"carousel-container\" data-carousel-engine=\"sdk\" data-orientation={emblaCtx.orientation}>{@render children?.()}</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t{/snippet}\n\t\t\t\t</SdkContent>\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t{/snippet}\n\t</SdkViewport>\n{:else}\n<div\n\tdata-slot=\"carousel-content\"\n\tclass=\"overflow-hidden\"\n\tuse:emblaCarouselSvelte={{\n\t\toptions: {\n\t\t\tcontainer: \"[data-embla-container]\",\n\t\t\tslides: \"[data-embla-slide]\",\n\t\t\t...emblaCtx.options,\n\t\t\taxis: emblaCtx.orientation === \"horizontal\" ? \"x\" : \"y\",\n\t\t},\n\t\tplugins: emblaCtx.plugins,\n\t}}\n\tonemblaInit={emblaCtx.onInit}\n>\n\t<div\n\t\tbind:this={ref}\n\t\tdata-slot=\"carousel-container\"\n\t\tdata-orientation={emblaCtx.orientation}\n\t\tclass={classes}\n\t\tdata-embla-container=\"\"\n\t\t{...restProps}\n\t>\n\t\t{@render children?.()}\n\t</div>\n</div>\n{/if}\n",
			"type": "registry:file",
			"target": "carousel/carousel-content.svelte"
		},
		{
			"content": "<script lang=\"ts\">\n\timport { CarouselItem as SdkItem } from \"@ui-sdk/svelte/carousel\";\n\timport { createAttachmentKey } from \"svelte/attachments\";\n\timport { cn, type WithElementRef } from \"$UTILS$.js\";\n\timport { getEmblaContext } from \"./context.js\";\n\timport type { HTMLAttributes } from \"svelte/elements\";\n\n\tlet {\n\t\tref = $bindable(null),\n\t\tclass: className,\n\t\tchildren,\n\t\t...restProps\n\t}: WithElementRef<HTMLAttributes<HTMLDivElement>> = $props();\n\n\tconst emblaCtx = getEmblaContext(\"<Carousel.Item/>\");\n\tconst attachKey = createAttachmentKey();\n\tfunction attachRef(element: HTMLDivElement) {\n\t\tref = element;\n\t\treturn () => { if (ref === element) ref = null; };\n\t}\n\tconst classes = $derived(cn(\"min-w-0 shrink-0 grow-0 basis-full\",\n\t\temblaCtx.orientation === \"horizontal\" ? \"ps-4\" : \"pt-4\",\n\t\tclassName));\n</script>\n\n{#if emblaCtx.sdk}\n\t<SdkItem data-slot=\"carousel-item\" aria-roledescription=\"幻灯片\" class={cn(\"min-w-0 shrink-0 grow-0 basis-full\", className)} {...restProps}>\n\t\t{#snippet render({ props })}\n\t\t\t<div {...{ ...props, [attachKey]: attachRef }}>{@render children?.()}</div>\n\t\t{/snippet}\n\t</SdkItem>\n{:else}\n<div\n\tbind:this={ref}\n\tdata-slot=\"carousel-item\"\n\tdata-orientation={emblaCtx.orientation}\n\trole=\"group\"\n\taria-roledescription=\"幻灯片\"\n\tclass={classes}\n\tdata-embla-slide=\"\"\n\t{...restProps}\n>\n\t{@render children?.()}\n</div>\n{/if}\n",
			"type": "registry:file",
			"target": "carousel/carousel-item.svelte"
		},
		{
			"content": "<script lang=\"ts\">\n\timport { CarouselNext as SdkNext } from \"@ui-sdk/svelte/carousel\";\n\timport IconPlaceholder from \"$lib/components/icon-placeholder/icon-placeholder.svelte\";\n\timport { Button, buttonVariants, type Props } from \"$UI$/button/index.js\";\n\timport { cn } from \"$UTILS$.js\";\n\timport { getEmblaContext } from \"./context.js\";\n\timport type { WithoutChildren } from \"bits-ui\";\n\n\tlet {\n\t\tref = $bindable(null),\n\t\tclass: className,\n\t\tvariant = \"outline\",\n\t\tsize = \"icon-sm\",\n\t\tlabel = \"下一张\",\n\t\tdisabled,\n\t\tonclick,\n\t\tonkeydown,\n\t\t...restProps\n\t}: WithoutChildren<Props> & {\n\t\t/** Screen reader text. */\n\t\tlabel?: string;\n\t} = $props();\n\n\tconst emblaCtx = getEmblaContext(\"<Carousel.Next/>\");\n\tconst classes = $derived(cn(\"rounded-full absolute touch-manipulation\",\n\t\temblaCtx.orientation === \"horizontal\" ? \"inset-y-0 -end-12 my-auto\" : \"start-1/2 -bottom-12 -translate-x-1/2 rotate-90\", className));\n\tfunction keydown(event: KeyboardEvent) {\n\t\tif (event.currentTarget instanceof HTMLAnchorElement) onkeydown?.(event as KeyboardEvent & { currentTarget: HTMLAnchorElement });\n\t\telse if (event.currentTarget instanceof HTMLButtonElement) onkeydown?.(event as KeyboardEvent & { currentTarget: HTMLButtonElement });\n\t\tif (!disabled) emblaCtx.handleKeyDown(event);\n\t}\n\tfunction click(event: MouseEvent) {\n\t\tif (event.currentTarget instanceof HTMLAnchorElement) return onclick?.(event as MouseEvent & { currentTarget: HTMLAnchorElement });\n\t\tif (event.currentTarget instanceof HTMLButtonElement) return onclick?.(event as MouseEvent & { currentTarget: HTMLButtonElement });\n\t}\n</script>\n\n{#if emblaCtx.sdk}\n<SdkNext {...restProps} data-slot=\"carousel-next\" data-variant={variant} data-size={size}\n\tclass={cn(buttonVariants({ variant, size }), \"aria-disabled:opacity-50\", classes)} {disabled} onclick={click} onkeydown={keydown}>\n\t{#snippet render({ props })}<button {...props} bind:this={ref}>{@render icon()}</button>{/snippet}\n</SdkNext>\n{:else}\n<Button\n\tdata-slot=\"carousel-next\"\n\t{variant}\n\t{size}\n\taria-disabled={disabled || !emblaCtx.canScrollNext}\n\tdisabled={disabled || !emblaCtx.canScrollNext}\n\tclass={classes}\n\tonclick={(event: MouseEvent) => { click(event); if (!event.defaultPrevented) emblaCtx.scrollNext(); }}\n\tonkeydown={keydown}\n\tbind:ref\n\t{...restProps}\n>\n\t{@render icon()}\n</Button>\n{/if}\n\n{#snippet icon()}\n\t<IconPlaceholder\n\t\tlucide=\"ChevronRightIcon\"\n\t\ttabler=\"IconChevronRight\"\n\t\thugeicons=\"ArrowRight01Icon\"\n\t\tphosphor=\"CaretRightIcon\"\n\t\tremixicon=\"RiArrowRightSLine\"\n\t\tclass={emblaCtx.orientation === \"horizontal\" ? \"cn-rtl-flip\" : undefined}\n\t/>\n\t<span class=\"sr-only\">{label}</span>\n{/snippet}\n",
			"type": "registry:file",
			"target": "carousel/carousel-next.svelte"
		},
		{
			"content": "<script lang=\"ts\">\n\timport { CarouselPrevious as SdkPrevious } from \"@ui-sdk/svelte/carousel\";\n\timport IconPlaceholder from \"$lib/components/icon-placeholder/icon-placeholder.svelte\";\n\timport { Button, buttonVariants, type Props } from \"$UI$/button/index.js\";\n\timport { cn } from \"$UTILS$.js\";\n\timport { getEmblaContext } from \"./context.js\";\n\timport type { WithoutChildren } from \"bits-ui\";\n\n\tlet {\n\t\tref = $bindable(null),\n\t\tclass: className,\n\t\tvariant = \"outline\",\n\t\tsize = \"icon-sm\",\n\t\tlabel = \"上一张\",\n\t\tdisabled,\n\t\tonclick,\n\t\tonkeydown,\n\t\t...restProps\n\t}: WithoutChildren<Props> & {\n\t\t/** Screen reader text. */\n\t\tlabel?: string;\n\t} = $props();\n\n\tconst emblaCtx = getEmblaContext(\"<Carousel.Previous/>\");\n\tconst classes = $derived(cn(\"rounded-full absolute touch-manipulation\",\n\t\temblaCtx.orientation === \"horizontal\" ? \"inset-y-0 -start-12 my-auto\" : \"start-1/2 -top-12 -translate-x-1/2 rotate-90\", className));\n\tfunction keydown(event: KeyboardEvent) {\n\t\tif (event.currentTarget instanceof HTMLAnchorElement) onkeydown?.(event as KeyboardEvent & { currentTarget: HTMLAnchorElement });\n\t\telse if (event.currentTarget instanceof HTMLButtonElement) onkeydown?.(event as KeyboardEvent & { currentTarget: HTMLButtonElement });\n\t\tif (!disabled) emblaCtx.handleKeyDown(event);\n\t}\n\tfunction click(event: MouseEvent) {\n\t\tif (event.currentTarget instanceof HTMLAnchorElement) return onclick?.(event as MouseEvent & { currentTarget: HTMLAnchorElement });\n\t\tif (event.currentTarget instanceof HTMLButtonElement) return onclick?.(event as MouseEvent & { currentTarget: HTMLButtonElement });\n\t}\n</script>\n\n{#if emblaCtx.sdk}\n<SdkPrevious {...restProps} data-slot=\"carousel-previous\" data-variant={variant} data-size={size}\n\tclass={cn(buttonVariants({ variant, size }), \"aria-disabled:opacity-50\", classes)} {disabled} onclick={click} onkeydown={keydown}>\n\t{#snippet render({ props })}<button {...props} bind:this={ref}>{@render icon()}</button>{/snippet}\n</SdkPrevious>\n{:else}\n<Button\n\tdata-slot=\"carousel-previous\"\n\t{variant}\n\t{size}\n\taria-disabled={disabled || !emblaCtx.canScrollPrev}\n\tdisabled={disabled || !emblaCtx.canScrollPrev}\n\tclass={classes}\n\tonclick={(event: MouseEvent) => { click(event); if (!event.defaultPrevented) emblaCtx.scrollPrev(); }}\n\tonkeydown={keydown}\n\t{...restProps}\n\tbind:ref\n>\n\t{@render icon()}\n</Button>\n{/if}\n\n{#snippet icon()}\n\t<IconPlaceholder\n\t\tlucide=\"ChevronLeftIcon\"\n\t\ttabler=\"IconChevronLeft\"\n\t\thugeicons=\"ArrowLeft01Icon\"\n\t\tphosphor=\"CaretLeftIcon\"\n\t\tremixicon=\"RiArrowLeftSLine\"\n\t\tclass={emblaCtx.orientation === \"horizontal\" ? \"cn-rtl-flip\" : undefined}\n\t/>\n\t<span class=\"sr-only\">{label}</span>\n{/snippet}\n",
			"type": "registry:file",
			"target": "carousel/carousel-previous.svelte"
		},
		{
			"content": "<script lang=\"ts\">\n\timport { Carousel as SdkCarousel, createCarouselController } from \"@ui-sdk/svelte/carousel\";\n\timport { createAttachmentKey } from \"svelte/attachments\";\n\timport { cn, type WithElementRef } from \"$UTILS$.js\";\n\timport {\n\t\ttype CarouselAPI,\n\t\ttype CarouselProps,\n\t\ttype EmblaContext,\n\t\tsetEmblaContext,\n\t} from \"./context.js\";\n\n\tlet {\n\t\tref = $bindable(null),\n\t\topts,\n\t\tplugins,\n\t\tsetApi,\n\t\torientation = \"horizontal\",\n\t\tclass: className,\n\t\tchildren,\n\t\t...restProps\n\t}: WithElementRef<CarouselProps> = $props();\n\tconst sdk = createCarouselController();\n\tconst attachKey = createAttachmentKey();\n\tfunction attachRef(element: HTMLDivElement) {\n\t\tref = element;\n\t\treturn () => { if (ref === element) ref = null; };\n\t}\n\n\t// svelte-ignore state_referenced_locally\n\tlet carouselState = $state<EmblaContext>({\n\t\tget sdk() { return opts || plugins || setApi ? undefined : sdk; },\n\t\tapi: undefined,\n\t\tscrollPrev,\n\t\tscrollNext,\n\t\tget orientation() { return orientation; },\n\t\tcanScrollNext: false,\n\t\tcanScrollPrev: false,\n\t\thandleKeyDown,\n\t\tget options() { return opts ?? {}; },\n\t\tget plugins() { return plugins ?? []; },\n\t\tonInit,\n\t\tscrollSnaps: [],\n\t\tselectedIndex: 0,\n\t\tscrollTo,\n\t});\n\n\tsetEmblaContext(carouselState);\n\n\tfunction scrollPrev() {\n\t\tcarouselState.api?.scrollPrev();\n\t}\n\n\tfunction scrollNext() {\n\t\tcarouselState.api?.scrollNext();\n\t}\n\n\tfunction scrollTo(index: number, jump?: boolean) {\n\t\tcarouselState.api?.scrollTo(index, jump);\n\t}\n\n\tfunction onSelect() {\n\t\tif (!carouselState.api) return;\n\t\tcarouselState.selectedIndex = carouselState.api.selectedScrollSnap();\n\t\tcarouselState.canScrollNext = carouselState.api.canScrollNext();\n\t\tcarouselState.canScrollPrev = carouselState.api.canScrollPrev();\n\t}\n\n\tfunction handleKeyDown(e: KeyboardEvent) {\n\t\tif (e.defaultPrevented || e.altKey || e.ctrlKey || e.metaKey || e.shiftKey) return;\n\t\tconst rtl = e.currentTarget instanceof HTMLElement && getComputedStyle(e.currentTarget).direction === \"rtl\";\n\t\tconst previous = orientation === \"vertical\" ? \"ArrowUp\" : rtl ? \"ArrowRight\" : \"ArrowLeft\";\n\t\tconst next = orientation === \"vertical\" ? \"ArrowDown\" : rtl ? \"ArrowLeft\" : \"ArrowRight\";\n\t\tif (e.key === previous) {\n\t\t\te.preventDefault();\n\t\t\tif (carouselState.sdk) sdk.previous({ reason: \"list-navigation\", event: e });\n\t\t\telse scrollPrev();\n\t\t} else if (e.key === next) {\n\t\t\te.preventDefault();\n\t\t\tif (carouselState.sdk) sdk.next({ reason: \"list-navigation\", event: e });\n\t\t\telse scrollNext();\n\t\t}\n\t}\n\n\tfunction onInit(event: CustomEvent<CarouselAPI>) {\n\t\tcarouselState.api = event.detail;\n\t\tsetApi?.(carouselState.api);\n\n\t\tcarouselState.scrollSnaps = carouselState.api.scrollSnapList();\n\t\tcarouselState.api.on(\"select\", onSelect);\n\t\tonSelect();\n\t}\n\n\t$effect(() => {\n\t\treturn () => {\n\t\t\tcarouselState.api?.off(\"select\", onSelect);\n\t\t};\n\t});\n</script>\n\n{#if carouselState.sdk}\n\t<SdkCarousel controller={sdk} {orientation} data-slot=\"carousel\" class={cn(\"relative\", className)} aria-roledescription=\"轮播\" {...restProps}>\n\t\t{#snippet render({ props })}\n\t\t\t<div {...{ ...props, [attachKey]: attachRef }}>{@render children?.()}</div>\n\t\t{/snippet}\n\t</SdkCarousel>\n{:else}\n<div\n\tbind:this={ref}\n\tdata-slot=\"carousel\"\n\tclass={cn(\"relative\", className)}\n\trole=\"region\"\n\taria-roledescription=\"轮播\"\n\t{...restProps}\n>\n\t{@render children?.()}\n</div>\n{/if}\n",
			"type": "registry:file",
			"target": "carousel/carousel.svelte"
		},
		{
			"content": "import { getContext, hasContext, setContext } from \"svelte\";\nimport type { CarouselController } from \"@ui-sdk/core/carousel\";\nimport type { WithElementRef } from \"$UTILS$.js\";\nimport type {\n\tEmblaCarouselSvelteType,\n\tdefault as emblaCarouselSvelte,\n} from \"embla-carousel-svelte\";\nimport type { HTMLAttributes } from \"svelte/elements\";\n\nexport type CarouselAPI =\n\tNonNullable<NonNullable<EmblaCarouselSvelteType[\"$$_attributes\"]>[\"on:emblaInit\"]> extends (\n\t\tevt: CustomEvent<infer CarouselAPI>\n\t) => void\n\t\t? CarouselAPI\n\t\t: never;\n\ntype EmblaCarouselConfig = NonNullable<Parameters<typeof emblaCarouselSvelte>[1]>;\n\nexport type CarouselOptions = EmblaCarouselConfig[\"options\"];\nexport type CarouselPlugins = EmblaCarouselConfig[\"plugins\"];\n\n////\n\nexport type CarouselProps = {\n\topts?: CarouselOptions;\n\tplugins?: CarouselPlugins;\n\tsetApi?: (api: CarouselAPI | undefined) => void;\n\torientation?: \"horizontal\" | \"vertical\";\n} & WithElementRef<HTMLAttributes<HTMLDivElement>>;\n\nconst EMBLA_CAROUSEL_CONTEXT = Symbol(\"EMBLA_CAROUSEL_CONTEXT\");\n\nexport type EmblaContext = {\n\tsdk?: CarouselController;\n\tapi: CarouselAPI | undefined;\n\torientation: \"horizontal\" | \"vertical\";\n\tscrollNext: () => void;\n\tscrollPrev: () => void;\n\tcanScrollNext: boolean;\n\tcanScrollPrev: boolean;\n\thandleKeyDown: (e: KeyboardEvent) => void;\n\toptions: CarouselOptions;\n\tplugins: CarouselPlugins;\n\tonInit: (e: CustomEvent<CarouselAPI>) => void;\n\tscrollTo: (index: number, jump?: boolean) => void;\n\tscrollSnaps: number[];\n\tselectedIndex: number;\n};\n\nexport function setEmblaContext(config: EmblaContext): EmblaContext {\n\tsetContext(EMBLA_CAROUSEL_CONTEXT, config);\n\treturn config;\n}\n\nexport function getEmblaContext(name = \"This component\") {\n\tif (!hasContext(EMBLA_CAROUSEL_CONTEXT)) {\n\t\tthrow new Error(`${name} must be used within a <Carousel.Root> component`);\n\t}\n\treturn getContext<ReturnType<typeof setEmblaContext>>(EMBLA_CAROUSEL_CONTEXT);\n}\n",
			"type": "registry:file",
			"target": "carousel/context.ts"
		},
		{
			"content": "import Content from \"./carousel-content.svelte\";\nimport Item from \"./carousel-item.svelte\";\nimport Next from \"./carousel-next.svelte\";\nimport Previous from \"./carousel-previous.svelte\";\nimport Root from \"./carousel.svelte\";\n\nexport {\n\tRoot,\n\tContent,\n\tItem,\n\tPrevious,\n\tNext,\n\t//\n\tRoot as Carousel,\n\tContent as CarouselContent,\n\tItem as CarouselItem,\n\tPrevious as CarouselPrevious,\n\tNext as CarouselNext,\n};\n",
			"type": "registry:file",
			"target": "carousel/index.ts"
		}
